ola is Person 1 → ✅\n\n   All attributes are uniquely assigned. Perfect.\n\nNow answer the questions:\n\n1. **What is the movie genre of the person who drinks mirinda?**  \n   → Person who drinks mirinda is Person 2 → Movie genre: superhero  \n   → Answer: **superhero**\n\n2. **At what position is the person who drinks mirinda?**  \n   → Person 2  \n   → Answer: **2**\n\n3. **What movie genre does the person who listens to classical watch?**  \n   → Person who listens to classical is Person 1 → Movie genre: spy  \n   → Answer: **spy**\n\n4. **What music genre does the person who drinks cola listen to?**  \n   → Person who drinks cola is Person 1 → Music genre: classical  \n   → Answer: **classical**\n\nFinal answers in order: superhero, 2, spy, classical\n\nFinal answer: <solution>superhero, 2, spy, classical</solution>", "logprobs": [{"token": "We", "logprob": -0.03804187476634979}, {"token": " are", "logprob": -0.0789945125579834}, {"token": " given", "logprob": -0.5759409070014954}, {"token": ":\n\n", "logprob": -0.4269537031650543}, {"token": "-", "logprob": -0.000660439720377326}, {"token": " Two", "logprob": -0.12155521661043167}, {"token": " people", "logprob": -6.079655122448457e-06}, {"token": " in", "logprob": -0.003969884943217039}, {"token": " a", "logprob": -8.749579137656838e-05}, {"token": " line", "logprob": -2.3841855067985307e-07}, {"token": ",", "logprob": -0.06202363595366478}, {"token": " numbered", "logprob": -0.14713487029075623}, {"token": " ", "logprob": -0.10010984539985657}, {"token": "1", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " (", "logprob": -0.0004905451205559075}, {"token": "left", "logprob": -2.3841855067985307e-07}, {"token": ")", "logprob": -7.688703772146255e-05}, {"token": " and", "logprob": -0.01416344940662384}, {"token": " ", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "2", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": " (", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": "right", "logprob": 0.0}, {"token": ").\n", "logprob": -0.0009065332706086338}, {"token": "-", "logprob": -2.384185506798530